---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Manifesto · Josh Approved"
  description="What we build, what we won't, and why."
>
  <div class="container">
    <Nav variant="full" />

    <article class="prose">
      <h1>Manifesto</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        Two people. A small library of small apps. Each one privacy-first, free by default, and open source.
      </p>

      <h2>What we make</h2>
      <p>
        We make replacements for paywalled utility apps — the kind that should not have a
        subscription in the first place. A timer. A converter. A summarizer. The kind of
        thing your phone can do without ever talking to a server.
      </p>

      <h2>What we don't make</h2>
      <p>
        We don't make apps that need accounts. We don't make apps that collect data
        "to improve the product." We don't make apps with a paywall in front of the
        feature you opened the app for.
      </p>

      <h2>How we work</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Client-side by default. If something has to talk to a server, we say so on the listing.</li>
        <li>Open source on GitHub. You can read the code. You can build it yourself.</li>
        <li>Pay-what-you-want. The whole app works without paying. If it saves you a subscription, throw us a few dollars.</li>
        <li>Volume over depth. We ship many small apps fast. We don't compete on a single flagship.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>What you can expect</h2>
      <p>
        Every Josh Approved app does one thing. It will not ask for your email. It will not
        nag you to rate it more than once. It will not show you an ad. The interface will
        look like the other Josh Approved apps, because they share a design system that we
        keep small on purpose.
      </p>

      <p>
        If we ever drift from this, the apps lose the badge.
      </p>
    </article>

    <Footer />
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .container {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 32px;
  }
  .prose {
    padding: 64px 0 32px;
  }
  .prose h1 {
    font-size: 48px;
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0 0 16px;
  }
  .prose h2 {
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin: 36px 0 12px;
  }
  .prose .lede {
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--fg-muted);
    margin: 0 0 24px;
  }
  .prose p {
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--fg);
    margin: 0 0 14px;
  }
  .prose ul {
    margin: 0 0 14px;
    padding-left: 20px;
  }
  .prose li {
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--fg);
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 540px) {
    .container { padding: 0 20px; }
    .prose h1 { font-size: 36px; }
    .prose { padding: 40px 0 24px; }
  }
</style>
